no-act: build without Authenticated Countdown Timers (ACT_SUPPORT = NO)

Classification: profile setting.

tpm-rs implements no ACTs, so no TPM_RH_ACT_x handle exists and
TPM2_ACT_SetTimeout is not implemented.

diff --git a/TPMCmd/TpmConfiguration/TpmConfiguration/TpmProfile_Common.h b/TPMCmd/TpmConfiguration/TpmConfiguration/TpmProfile_Common.h
--- a/TPMCmd/TpmConfiguration/TpmConfiguration/TpmProfile_Common.h
+++ b/TPMCmd/TpmConfiguration/TpmConfiguration/TpmProfile_Common.h
@@ -154,7 +154,7 @@
 //***********************************************
 // Defines controlling ACT
 //***********************************************
-#define ACT_SUPPORT                         YES
+#define ACT_SUPPORT                         NO
 #define RH_ACT_0                                (YES * ACT_SUPPORT)
 #define RH_ACT_1                                ( NO * ACT_SUPPORT)
 #define RH_ACT_2                                ( NO * ACT_SUPPORT)
